{%- comment -%}
  Shared static taxonomy for Search and the article review index.

  These country definitions drive both Search and the article review index.
  Keep their separators stable so both consumers continue to parse the same
  labels and tag aliases. The producer string remains a Search compatibility
  value and should retain its existing labels, ordering and aliases. Do not
  append fields to it: Search boundary-tests it as "|Label|" to keep
  producer-named drink tags out of its "Other Drinks" filter. Per-producer
  data belongs in a parallel string, as the producer origins below do.
{%- endcomment -%}
